        <ArticleTitle>Reverse genetics and <i>viral rescue</i> of influenza A</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND" NlmCategory="BACKGROUND">Influenza reverse genetics enables controlled virus generation.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="METHODS" NlmCategory="METHODS">We performed viral rescue using transfection in mammalian cell culture.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="RESULTS" NlmCategory="RESULTS">Recombinant viruses were recovered with high efficiency.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSIONS" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">The platform supports infectious clone workflows.</AbstractText>
